# Never commit a real personal corpus. It is private writing (sent email, texts, etc).
# The skill names the raw source file corpus.md and writes bundles to ~/VoicePack/
# (outside this repo) by default. The rules below are a safety net in case someone
# points the output into this repo. If you assemble your corpus under a different
# filename, add it here.
#
# Patterns are anchored with a leading slash so they only match this repo's root,
# not directories like examples/voicepack/ (macOS filesystems are case-insensitive,
# so an unanchored pattern would over-match).

corpus.md
/VoicePack/
/output/
/my-voice/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
